                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Tonight I'm holding a Tele-Town Hall at 5:30 AZ time \u2014 you can dial in to join us at 833-479-1991 or watch live at https://t.co/1kp2EEDC4j.\n\nI look forward to answering your questions about the health care coverage cliff and what the government shutdown means for you.",
