                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "With families facing uncertainty about coverage and costs, strong hospital leadership matters.\n\nI look forward to working with Dignity Health East Valley's new president Dr. Mario Garner to ensure we can keep health care accessible to our communities.",
