                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "What Trump\u2019s health care plan means for you:\n\n\ud83d\ude91 33,000+ East Valley residents seeing their coverage costs double\n\n\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83e\ude79 Families rationing insulin and skipping trips to the doctor\n\n\ud83c\udfe5 Rural clinics forced to close their doors\n\nWe need to save health care.",
