                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Read that again: $484 \u2192 $2,225 per month.\n\nIf Republicans refuse to save health care, premiums could soar to over 4x the cost for couples like this one in Mesa.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to keep coverage affordable for families across the country. https://t.co/umIbWTMUkT",
