                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Health care is one of the biggest costs for working families. When premiums rise, everything else is harder to afford.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m backing an amendment that would extend Affordable Care Act savings for three more years \u2014 keeping coverage affordable for millions of families.",
